{
    "prompt": "Write a behavior tree for the robot to execute the command using only available nodes. If object is near, pick it up, check it, and put it down. If not, search for it and move to specific location. list of available nodes: <Action ID = PickUpObject    /> <Action ID = PutDownObject    /> <Action ID = MoveToSpecificLocation    /> <Action ID = MoveToObjects    /> <Action ID = CheckObjectProperties    /> <SubTree ID = SearchForObject    /> <Condition ID = IsObjectApproached    />",
